              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kindu kenene keveeye ndi, liiva lie limenya lienyu lidukanaa live kuli Ivangeri ya Kristo yenya, kunangwa, kali niiva ndaza, anoho niimbura kuuza ndakahuliri ndi munyi mwasingira vudinyu harara kandi muveeye ni kivuni kilala. Nandio, mulava ni mulwaniraa uvulala vwi Ivangeri mu lisuuvira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutatia avasigu vinyu mba; muve avaluviriri kazozo. Yiki kilava ekelolero kuvamanyia ndi valagotiza navuzwa munyi mulaguuta, kigira Nyasaye niyie uhaanaa ku munyi iliguuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyi muheveywi uvwiyangu vwukutumikira Kristo, sigaveeye ku lisuuvira muye lienyine, navuzwa kandi kigira ilisalira kigira Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyi harara ninzi koveeye mu vulwani vulala vwere kuli mwaandola mazambiri, kandi vwa muhulira, inzi ngilwaanaa vulwani yivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kristo aveeye mwegehizi kandi munene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
